<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Puffer Isle Resort | Tropical Escape</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/islelogo.png">

  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');

    :root {
      /* Swapped: Teal is now the subtle accent, Yellow is the Brand Power */
      --brand-color: #FFD700; 
      --brand-hover: #e6c200;
      --accent-teal: #008080;
      --dark: #1a1a1a;
      --light-bg: #ffffff;
      --text-muted: #555;
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      color: var(--dark);
      background-color: var(--light-bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ================= HERO ================= */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero video {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(50%); /* Darker for better text pop */
    }

    .hero-text {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem;
      border-radius: 24px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      animation: fadeInUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1) forwards;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .hero-text h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-text span {
      color: var(--brand-color);
    }

    .hero-text p {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .hero-logo {
      width: 170px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5));
    }

    .hero-btn {
      background: var(--brand-color);
      color: var(--dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 16px 40px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .hero-btn:hover {
      background: white;
      color: var(--dark);
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    /* ================= SLEEK ABOUT SECTION ================= */
    #about {
      padding: 100px 10%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-image-stack {
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-image-stack img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 20px 20px 0px var(--brand-color);
    }

    .about-content {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .about-content h2::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -10px;
      left: 0;
      width: 60px;
      height: 5px;
      background: var(--brand-color);
    }

    .about-content p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ================= CONTACT SECTION ================= */
    #contact { 
      padding: 100px 5%;
      background: #fdfdfd; 
    }

    #contact h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .contact-container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .map {
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      height: 450px;
    }

    .contact-info {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 3rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .contact-info h3 {
      color: var(--brand-color);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-info p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .contact-btn {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--brand-color);
      color: var(--dark);
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-btn:hover {
      background: white;
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    /* ================= FOOTER ================= */
    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      #about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
      .about-content h2::after { left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
      .contact-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .map { height: 300px; order: 2; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/resort1.jpg">
      <source src="/videos/resort2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>

    <div class="hero-text">
      <img src="/images/islelogo.png" alt="Resort Logo" class="hero-logo">
      <h2>Experience <span>Puffer Isle</span></h2>
      <p>A sanctuary where the sky kisses the sea and luxury meets the wild.</p>

      <% if (user) { %>
        <a href="/booking" class="hero-btn">Start Your Journey</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="#" id="heroBookingBtn" class="hero-btn">Start Your Journey</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="about-image-stack">
      <img src="/images/resort1.jpg" alt="Resort View">
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>About Our Isle</h2>
      <p>
        Puffer Isle Resort offers a transcendent escape into nature, blending traditional Filipino hospitality with modern coastal comfort. From our climate-controlled suites to the rustic charm of our seaside <strong>Bahay Kubo</strong>, every corner is designed for serenity.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're lounging by our crystal-clear pools, pitching a tent under the starlit canopy, or enjoying a private dinner by the shore, your time here is defined by peace. <strong>Our mission is to provide more than just a stay; we provide a space where memories are woven into the very fabric of the island's breeze.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Connect With Us</h2>

    <div class="contact-container">
      <div class="map">
        <iframe 
          src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3859.794746437253!2d121.3917462153302!3d15.259247498997667!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x339743e2cdc9555f%3A0x7564b23bbd7617b9!2sPuffer%20Isle%20Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1700000000000!5m2!1sen!2sph" 
          width="100%" height="100%" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy">
        </iframe >
      </div>

      <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
        <p><strong>📞</strong> 0900-000-0000</p>
        <p><strong>✉️</strong> info@pufferisleresort.com</p>
        <p><strong>📍</strong> Puffer Isle, Coastal Road, Philippines</p>
        <a href="#" class="contact-btn">Message Us on Facebook</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Puffer Isle Resort. Designed for Ultimate Serenity.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
      const heroBookingBtn = document.getElementById("heroBookingBtn");
      const modal = document.getElementById("authModal");

      heroBookingBtn?.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        if(modal) modal.style.display = "flex";
      });
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>